Verse 1
Some [G]day the silver [C]cord will [G]break, and I no more as [A]now shall [D]sing,
but [G]O the joy when [C]I shall [G]wake with[C]in the [G]palace [D]of the [G]King!

Chorus
And [G]I shall see him [C]face to [G]face, and tell the story, [D]saved by grace;
and [G]I shall see him [C]face to [G]face, and [C]tell the [G]story, [D]saved by [G]grace.
